      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Source of truth: needed/portless_automation_gap_analysis.md (2026-10-19), backend/shared/orchestration/{continuations,autonomy_policy,deal_watcher,notifications}.py, services/hitl_approval/callbacks.py, shared/domain/state_machine.py.  Read left → right along the deal timeline. Each column is one step; the lanes say who performs it, which HITL gate guards it, which external party must act, what catches silence, and what\nstill blocks 'completely automatic'. The bottom section is the target design: the twelve additions that close the loop, and the autonomy ramp to switch them on.",
