      "updated": 1792389866279,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "EVENT BUS — NATS JetStream stream PORTLESS_EVENTS (subjects portless.<topic>) · one durable pull consumer per topic, registered in the monolith only (register_continuations, 17 topics) · at-least-once: handler failure → NAK + backoff → after NATS_MAX_DELIVER → TERM + dead-letter deal.exception · publish() never raises (broker outage → in-process fallback, loud log)",
      "fontSize": 11.5,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "lnDnydt4haYAEUhgaRn4",
      "originalText": "EVENT BUS — NATS JetStream stream PORTLESS_EVENTS (subjects portless.<topic>) · one durable pull consumer per topic, registered in the monolith only (register_continuations, 17 topics) · at-least-once: handler failure → NAK + backoff → after NATS_MAX_DELIVER → TERM + dead-letter deal.exception · publish() never raises (broker outage → in-process fallback, loud log)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b1w"
    },
