      "text": "config switch, not a gate: AUTO_D\nEAL_FROM_OPPORTUNITY_ENABLED\n(default OFF) +\nAUTO_DEAL_MIN_ARBITRAGE_RANK /\nMIN_CONFIDENCE; UI 'Start Deal'\notherwise",
