      "text": "EXCEPTION RESOLVER (LangGraph): OPEN → ANALYZING (LLM\nclassifies into 10 categories + plan) → REMEDIATING →\nRESOLVED | ESCALATED (RESOLVE_EXCEPTION gate, L0) |\nUNRESOLVABLE. AUTO_FIX today: DOCUMENT_ERROR (DocuGen\nregen), CONNECTOR_ERROR only",
