      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792389866279,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "GAPS → FIX (Discover)\nA-2 Buyer price is a heuristic (1.25 × cheapest FOB). CMS,\nmargin guard and the negotiation corridor are anchored on a\nmade-up number.\n→ Buyer target from a real source (manifest data, buyer RFQ\nprice, operator input) with provenance; refuse AUTO_DEAL\nwithout it. [P1-D1, P1-7]\n5.B Live demand data (Comtrade / Census keys, manifests).\nSimulated SHA-256 opportunities are blocked from auto-deal\nby design. [P1-D1a]\n5.C P1-1 production config gate: refuse to boot with stubs,\nlog-only mail, in-process bus, TRADE_MIN_MOCK_MODE or\nAUTO_FLOW_ENABLED.",
      "fontSize": 11.5,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "NDjCKviDtvXkDXC5slpo",
      "originalText": "GAPS → FIX (Discover)\nA-2 Buyer price is a heuristic (1.25 × cheapest FOB). CMS,\nmargin guard and the negotiation corridor are anchored on a\nmade-up number.\n→ Buyer target from a real source (manifest data, buyer RFQ\nprice, operator input) with provenance; refuse AUTO_DEAL\nwithout it. [P1-D1, P1-7]\n5.B Live demand data (Comtrade / Census keys, manifests).\nSimulated SHA-256 opportunities are blocked from auto-deal\nby design. [P1-D1a]\n5.C P1-1 production config gate: refuse to boot with stubs,\nlog-only mail, in-process bus, TRADE_MIN_MOCK_MODE or\nAUTO_FLOW_ENABLED.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b3M"
    },
