      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "GAPS → FIX (Source)\nA-1 Supplier quote intake by email is still MANUAL — the last stage where an operator re-types\ncounterparty data.\n→ Send RFQs by email too (notifications.py, subject token [RFQ:<rfq_id>]); add an RFQ branch\nto the Email Processor mapper; extract price / quantity / GSTIN (body + attachments) with the\nextractor + LLM; call receive_quote(). [P3-5]\nRECOMMEND auto-select rule: verification PASS + CMS ≥ 75 + ≥ 2 quotes →\nCONFIRM_SUPPLIER_SELECTION at L2; keep forced L0 only when GST / IEC verification failed.\nKNOWN LIMIT a supplier not scored by the Match Engine gets a zero-component MatchResult (quote\nprice as FOB) — enough to open the corridor, not a real CMS.",
      "fontSize": 11.5,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "6sNYgYB6xoNc3SxH3EYo",
      "originalText": "GAPS → FIX (Source)\nA-1 Supplier quote intake by email is still MANUAL — the last stage where an operator re-types\ncounterparty data.\n→ Send RFQs by email too (notifications.py, subject token [RFQ:<rfq_id>]); add an RFQ branch\nto the Email Processor mapper; extract price / quantity / GSTIN (body + attachments) with the\nextractor + LLM; call receive_quote(). [P3-5]\nRECOMMEND auto-select rule: verification PASS + CMS ≥ 75 + ≥ 2 quotes →\nCONFIRM_SUPPLIER_SELECTION at L2; keep forced L0 only when GST / IEC verification failed.\nKNOWN LIMIT a supplier not scored by the Match Engine gets a zero-component MatchResult (quote\nprice as FOB) — enough to open the corridor, not a real CMS.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b3O"
    },
