      "updated": 1792389866279,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "GAPS → FIX (Negotiate)\nA-8 Email transport is a 15-min IMAP poll on a single mailbox; buyer and supplier replies share one inbox.\n→ SendGrid / Mailgun inbound-parse webhooks (verification placeholders exist) + IMAP IDLE fallback; per-deal reply-to\ndeal+<id>@domain. [P3-3, P1-9]\nA-10 NEGOTIATION_FAILED always escalates. → resolver playbook: auto re-match when a next SOURCE candidate exists (the gate already\nexists), else escalate.\n5.B Own email domain + SPF / DKIM / DMARC + transactional provider — today mail leaves from a personal Gmail app password. [B-9,\nP1-8]\nRECOMMEND after a shadow period: AUTONOMY_SEND_NEGOTIATION_EMAIL=L2, AUTONOMY_CONFIRM_NEGOTIATION_AGREEMENT=L2,\nHITL_ON_FIRST_OUTBOUND=false. Keep degraded / placeholder drafts at L0 (no policy lifts it).",
      "fontSize": 11.5,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "zw8pwC24ZYfM67joTepR",
      "originalText": "GAPS → FIX (Negotiate)\nA-8 Email transport is a 15-min IMAP poll on a single mailbox; buyer and supplier replies share one inbox.\n→ SendGrid / Mailgun inbound-parse webhooks (verification placeholders exist) + IMAP IDLE fallback; per-deal reply-to\ndeal+<id>@domain. [P3-3, P1-9]\nA-10 NEGOTIATION_FAILED always escalates. → resolver playbook: auto re-match when a next SOURCE candidate exists (the gate already\nexists), else escalate.\n5.B Own email domain + SPF / DKIM / DMARC + transactional provider — today mail leaves from a personal Gmail app password. [B-9,\nP1-8]\nRECOMMEND after a shadow period: AUTONOMY_SEND_NEGOTIATION_EMAIL=L2, AUTONOMY_CONFIRM_NEGOTIATION_AGREEMENT=L2,\nHITL_ON_FIRST_OUTBOUND=false. Keep degraded / placeholder drafts at L0 (no policy lifts it).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b3Q"
    },
