      "versionNonce": 2018950643,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792389866279,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "GAPS → FIX (Contract)\n5.B Neutral escrow provider KYB (Tazapay / Escrow.com) — create_escrow() is a stub; the checkout_url in the buyer email is fake; nothing can actually be funded.\n[P1-4]\nA-9 No PDF attachment on the PI email (Drive link only when the store is Drive). → attachment support in SendEmailRequest + PDF rendering. [P3-3]\nA-5 Deal-watcher dedupe is in-process; a restart re-raises a still-stuck deal. → persist (deal, kind) on the deal record or check the resolver for an open exception.\n[X-10]\nRECOMMEND hosted, signed one-click 'Accept PI' and 'Fund escrow' links in the PI / funding emails → a deterministic signal instead of free-text parsing;\nCONFIRM_PI_ACCEPTANCE can run at L2 on link click while free-text replies keep PARSE_INBOUND_EMAIL.\n5.C Replay protection + mandatory secrets on every money webhook. [P1-9]",
      "fontSize": 11.5,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "r5lKUSV9rVi5MELMfB6b",
      "originalText": "GAPS → FIX (Contract)\n5.B Neutral escrow provider KYB (Tazapay / Escrow.com) — create_escrow() is a stub; the checkout_url in the buyer email is fake; nothing can actually be funded.\n[P1-4]\nA-9 No PDF attachment on the PI email (Drive link only when the store is Drive). → attachment support in SendEmailRequest + PDF rendering. [P3-3]\nA-5 Deal-watcher dedupe is in-process; a restart re-raises a still-stuck deal. → persist (deal, kind) on the deal record or check the resolver for an open exception.\n[X-10]\nRECOMMEND hosted, signed one-click 'Accept PI' and 'Fund escrow' links in the PI / funding emails → a deterministic signal instead of free-text parsing;\nCONFIRM_PI_ACCEPTANCE can run at L2 on link click while free-text replies keep PARSE_INBOUND_EMAIL.\n5.C Replay protection + mandatory secrets on every money webhook. [P1-9]",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b3S"
    },
