      "versionNonce": 1833994131,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792389866279,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "GAPS → FIX (Produce & Inspect)\n5.B QC provider API keys (QIMA first — the only public API). Bookings are stubs; no webhook ever arrives; the deal parks at SUPPLIER_DISPATCH_READY until the watcher raises a stall. [Phase 7]\nA-3 Legacy (Stripe hold + Payoneer, marks the whole hold RELEASED) and neutral (staged tranche ledger) escrow models coexist — the ledger can read 100 % while tranches say 90 %. → decide neutral, route\nRELEASE_SUPPLIER_PAYOUT through the tranche ledger. [P1-4, P1-6]\nP2-3 No PI ↔ PO ↔ CI ↔ CRF consistency check before T2 — tranche gates attach proof refs but nothing verifies quantities. → wire dual_doc_match_ok() (already in state_machine.py) as a hard precondition\nof every RELEASE_ESCROW_TRANCHE gate.\nA-10 QC_FAILED always escalates. → re-inspection playbook (book re-QC with the same inspector, notify supplier, cap at 1 retry) before DISPUTE.\nKNOWN LIMIT document pack uses deal defaults for packaging / weights / vessel; PI_SENT, PO_ISSUED, QC_PASSED arrive twice (owner emit + Deals emitter) — all legs idempotent.",
      "fontSize": 11.5,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "DGfL72dkuY6iptPZ5Aoo",
      "originalText": "GAPS → FIX (Produce & Inspect)\n5.B QC provider API keys (QIMA first — the only public API). Bookings are stubs; no webhook ever arrives; the deal parks at SUPPLIER_DISPATCH_READY until the watcher raises a stall. [Phase 7]\nA-3 Legacy (Stripe hold + Payoneer, marks the whole hold RELEASED) and neutral (staged tranche ledger) escrow models coexist — the ledger can read 100 % while tranches say 90 %. → decide neutral, route\nRELEASE_SUPPLIER_PAYOUT through the tranche ledger. [P1-4, P1-6]\nP2-3 No PI ↔ PO ↔ CI ↔ CRF consistency check before T2 — tranche gates attach proof refs but nothing verifies quantities. → wire dual_doc_match_ok() (already in state_machine.py) as a hard precondition\nof every RELEASE_ESCROW_TRANCHE gate.\nA-10 QC_FAILED always escalates. → re-inspection playbook (book re-QC with the same inspector, notify supplier, cap at 1 retry) before DISPUTE.\nKNOWN LIMIT document pack uses deal defaults for packaging / weights / vessel; PI_SENT, PO_ISSUED, QC_PASSED arrive twice (owner emit + Deals emitter) — all legs idempotent.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b3U"
    },
