      "seed": 60941879,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1604328755,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792389866279,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "GAPS → FIX (Ship & Clear)\n5.B Freight keys (Cogoport / Freightos) — booking stub, no milestone webhook → the deal never reaches CLEARED. CHA / ICEGATE\nregistration needs IEC + AD code. [Phase 7, B-6, B-7, P2-1]\nX-8 Vessel data entered at freight time does not back-fill CI / PL rendered at QC_PASSED (Shipping Bill is re-rendered only if\nmissing). → re-render the whole pack on freight.booked with a new version hash.\nA-10 FREIGHT_DELAY / CUSTOMS_REJECTED playbooks: re-quote with the other forwarder; re-file with corrected documents.\nRECOMMEND cargo-insurance connector (ECGC / broker API) booked in the same leg as freight; attach policy ref to the FILE_CUSTOMS\ngate.",
      "fontSize": 11.5,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "XZuoOAupSZ3mSobY8iAg",
      "originalText": "GAPS → FIX (Ship & Clear)\n5.B Freight keys (Cogoport / Freightos) — booking stub, no milestone webhook → the deal never reaches CLEARED. CHA / ICEGATE\nregistration needs IEC + AD code. [Phase 7, B-6, B-7, P2-1]\nX-8 Vessel data entered at freight time does not back-fill CI / PL rendered at QC_PASSED (Shipping Bill is re-rendered only if\nmissing). → re-render the whole pack on freight.booked with a new version hash.\nA-10 FREIGHT_DELAY / CUSTOMS_REJECTED playbooks: re-quote with the other forwarder; re-file with corrected documents.\nRECOMMEND cargo-insurance connector (ECGC / broker API) booked in the same leg as freight; attach policy ref to the FILE_CUSTOMS\ngate.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b3W"
    },
