      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792389866279,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "GAPS → FIX (Settle & Close)\nA-4 T4 (final 10 %) and the PortLess margin wait on buyer silence — nobody tells the buyer the\ninspection window is open. → inspection_window_open notification when T3 releases +\nauto-release on window lapse (deal_watcher).\n5.C Before raising AUTONOMY_MONEY_CEILING: double-entry ledger with invariant checks +\nauto-freeze [P1-6]; four-eyes approval above a value threshold + MFA for approvers [P1-11].\nThe L1 ceiling is the stop-gap.\nP2-5 No ledger close / evidence pack at PAID (realized margin is patched, nothing is\narchived).",
      "fontSize": 11.5,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "rHqjarHphXvpQsMchCLV",
      "originalText": "GAPS → FIX (Settle & Close)\nA-4 T4 (final 10 %) and the PortLess margin wait on buyer silence — nobody tells the buyer the\ninspection window is open. → inspection_window_open notification when T3 releases +\nauto-release on window lapse (deal_watcher).\n5.C Before raising AUTONOMY_MONEY_CEILING: double-entry ledger with invariant checks +\nauto-freeze [P1-6]; four-eyes approval above a value threshold + MFA for approvers [P1-11].\nThe L1 ceiling is the stop-gap.\nP2-5 No ledger close / evidence pack at PAID (realized margin is patched, nothing is\narchived).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b3Y"
    },
    {
      "id": "QyxHh7PMwOAymP2DL7UN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 1470.9,
      "width": 2170,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
