      "locked": false,
      "text": "TARGET DESIGN — twelve additions that close the loop so a deal runs opportunity → PAID with no human except where money moves",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "TARGET DESIGN — twelve additions that close the loop so a deal runs opportunity → PAID with no human except where money moves",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b3Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "UyIjFXLwtswBVYTlHijo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 1514.9,
      "width": 3400,
      "height": 17.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 331786780,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 957000819,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792389866279,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Three rules kept: (1) events move deals, not pollers — every leg is a durable-bus subscriber; (2) the pipeline creates gates, never approves them — autonomy lives only in autonomy_policy.py; (3) counterparty actions stay counterparty actions — PortLess makes them possible (sends, links, reminders) and noticed (webhooks, inbound parsing, SLA exceptions), never fakes them.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Three rules kept: (1) events move deals, not pollers — every leg is a durable-bus subscriber; (2) the pipeline creates gates, never approves them — autonomy lives only in autonomy_policy.py; (3) counterparty actions stay counterparty actions — PortLess makes them possible (sends, links, reminders) and noticed (webhooks, inbound parsing, SLA exceptions), never fakes them.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b3a"
    },
