      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 2122491411,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792389866279,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "① Transactional outbox + relay\n\nMongo write and DomainEvent persisted in one transaction; a relay publishes to NATS and marks rows sent. A crash between commit and publish no\nlonger loses the trigger (today the watcher only notices the stall 7 days later).\n\nCloses A-7 · P3-1a",
      "fontSize": 12.5,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "IcKgR4mSmxVNNii0xoKq",
      "originalText": "① Transactional outbox + relay\n\nMongo write and DomainEvent persisted in one transaction; a relay publishes to NATS and marks rows sent. A crash between commit and publish no\nlonger loses the trigger (today the watcher only notices the stall 7 days later).\n\nCloses A-7 · P3-1a",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b3c"
    },
