      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792389866279,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "② Continuation consumer worker\n\nStandalone process that runs register_continuations() against the JetStream durable consumers and calls peers through each module's client.py.\nPer-service deployment keeps full automation instead of losing it outside the monolith.\n\nCloses A-6 · O-5",
      "fontSize": 12.5,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "YEePBF8qUBoKTcGlOhMW",
      "originalText": "② Continuation consumer worker\n\nStandalone process that runs register_continuations() against the JetStream durable consumers and calls peers through each module's client.py.\nPer-service deployment keeps full automation instead of losing it outside the monolith.\n\nCloses A-6 · O-5",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b3e"
    },
