      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792389866279,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "③ Inbound email ingress\n\nSendGrid / Mailgun inbound-parse webhook (+ IMAP IDLE fallback) into the Email Processor; per-deal reply-to deal+<id>@domain; thread tokens\n[NEG:] [RFQ:] [PI:]. Round latency drops from 15 min to seconds; buyer and supplier mail no longer share one inbox.\n\nCloses A-8 · P3-3 · P1-9 · B-9 / P1-8",
      "fontSize": 12.5,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "bVVaIfo5eNej6zXNpuNM",
      "originalText": "③ Inbound email ingress\n\nSendGrid / Mailgun inbound-parse webhook (+ IMAP IDLE fallback) into the Email Processor; per-deal reply-to deal+<id>@domain; thread tokens\n[NEG:] [RFQ:] [PI:]. Round latency drops from 15 min to seconds; buyer and supplier mail no longer share one inbox.\n\nCloses A-8 · P3-3 · P1-9 · B-9 / P1-8",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b3g"
    },
