      "updated": 1792389866279,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "④ RFQ-by-email intake\n\nRFQ sent with an [RFQ:<rfq_id>] token; mapper RFQ branch; LLM extraction of price / quantity / GSTIN / lead time from body and attachments\n(PDF, XLSX); → sourcing.receive_quote() → verification → Match Engine. Removes the last manual re-typing stage.\n\nCloses A-1 · P3-5",
      "fontSize": 12.5,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "WG15RuNfibJvfR3RUNxI",
      "originalText": "④ RFQ-by-email intake\n\nRFQ sent with an [RFQ:<rfq_id>] token; mapper RFQ branch; LLM extraction of price / quantity / GSTIN / lead time from body and attachments\n(PDF, XLSX); → sourcing.receive_quote() → verification → Match Engine. Removes the last manual re-typing stage.\n\nCloses A-1 · P3-5",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b3i"
    },
