      "updated": 1792389866279,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "⑤ Buyer price service\n\nTarget price with provenance (manifest / Volza line, buyer RFQ, operator input) stored on the deal; the 1.25 × FOB heuristic becomes a flagged\nfallback only; AUTO_DEAL_FROM_OPPORTUNITY refuses to create a deal without a real price.\n\nCloses A-2 · P1-D1 · P1-7",
      "fontSize": 12.5,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "X31iNXc0qsiV7Te9MyMt",
      "originalText": "⑤ Buyer price service\n\nTarget price with provenance (manifest / Volza line, buyer RFQ, operator input) stored on the deal; the 1.25 × FOB heuristic becomes a flagged\nfallback only; AUTO_DEAL_FROM_OPPORTUNITY refuses to create a deal without a real price.\n\nCloses A-2 · P1-D1 · P1-7",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b3k"
    },
