      "updated": 1792389866279,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "⑥ Hosted counterparty action pages\n\nSigned one-click links in every outbound email: Accept PI, Fund escrow (provider checkout), Approve QC report, Confirm receipt (T4). A click is\na deterministic signal, so CONFIRM_PI_ACCEPTANCE and T4 can run at L2; free-text replies keep the PARSE_INBOUND_EMAIL path.\n\nCloses A-4 · hardens S12 / S14 / S27",
      "fontSize": 12.5,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "ZjKwhxSdkLhAf5qIDge9",
      "originalText": "⑥ Hosted counterparty action pages\n\nSigned one-click links in every outbound email: Accept PI, Fund escrow (provider checkout), Approve QC report, Confirm receipt (T4). A click is\na deterministic signal, so CONFIRM_PI_ACCEPTANCE and T4 can run at L2; free-text replies keep the PARSE_INBOUND_EMAIL path.\n\nCloses A-4 · hardens S12 / S14 / S27",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b3m"
    },
