      "updated": 1792389866279,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "⑦ Ledger + four-eyes\n\nDouble-entry ledger for hold / release / refund / payout / fee / FX with invariant checks and auto-freeze; one escrow model (neutral staged)\nwith RELEASE_SUPPLIER_PAYOUT routed through the tranche ledger; dual approval + MFA above a value threshold.\n\nCloses A-3 · P1-6 · P1-11 → unlocks raising AUTONOMY_MONEY_CEILING",
      "fontSize": 12.5,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "SYAiMEha3y2PcF1cZGoZ",
      "originalText": "⑦ Ledger + four-eyes\n\nDouble-entry ledger for hold / release / refund / payout / fee / FX with invariant checks and auto-freeze; one escrow model (neutral staged)\nwith RELEASE_SUPPLIER_PAYOUT routed through the tranche ledger; dual approval + MFA above a value threshold.\n\nCloses A-3 · P1-6 · P1-11 → unlocks raising AUTONOMY_MONEY_CEILING",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b3o"
    },
