      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792389866279,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "⑧ Resolver playbooks (AUTO_FIX per category)\n\nNEGOTIATION_FAILED → re-match next SOURCE candidate · QC_FAILED → one re-inspection · FREIGHT_DELAY → re-quote other forwarder ·\nCUSTOMS_REJECTED → re-file corrected pack · PAYMENT_FAILED → retry with backoff · MARGIN_BREACH → reopen negotiation at ROUND. Escalate only\nwhen the playbook is exhausted.\n\nCloses A-10",
      "fontSize": 12.5,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "SO6oM0jz6SSIo6ww4Rhn",
      "originalText": "⑧ Resolver playbooks (AUTO_FIX per category)\n\nNEGOTIATION_FAILED → re-match next SOURCE candidate · QC_FAILED → one re-inspection · FREIGHT_DELAY → re-quote other forwarder ·\nCUSTOMS_REJECTED → re-file corrected pack · PAYMENT_FAILED → retry with backoff · MARGIN_BREACH → reopen negotiation at ROUND. Escalate only\nwhen the playbook is exhausted.\n\nCloses A-10",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b3q"
    },
