      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "⑩ Document pack v2 + cross-doc guard\n\nPDF rendering + attachments on PI / PO / shipment emails; dual_doc_match_ok() (PI ↔ PO ↔ CI ↔ CRF ↔ BoL, 0.1 % tolerance) as a hard\nprecondition of T2 / T3 / payout gates; whole pack re-rendered (versioned) at freight.booked so vessel data back-fills.\n\nCloses A-9 · P2-3 · X-8 · P2-5 (evidence pack)",
      "fontSize": 12.5,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "aL3ofQYGJf2RHh9eK1LM",
      "originalText": "⑩ Document pack v2 + cross-doc guard\n\nPDF rendering + attachments on PI / PO / shipment emails; dual_doc_match_ok() (PI ↔ PO ↔ CI ↔ CRF ↔ BoL, 0.1 % tolerance) as a hard\nprecondition of T2 / T3 / payout gates; whole pack re-rendered (versioned) at freight.booked so vessel data back-fills.\n\nCloses A-9 · P2-3 · X-8 · P2-5 (evidence pack)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b3u"
