      "updated": 1792389866279,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "⑪ Durable watcher + reminder state\n\nPersist (deal, kind, fired_at) for every reminder and exception the deal_watcher raises; before raising, ask the resolver for an open exception\nat the same stage. Restarts never re-raise; reminders never exceed DEAL_REMINDER_MAX across deploys.\n\nCloses A-5 · X-10",
      "fontSize": 12.5,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "HxroyBtnMCEYLKJvUW88",
      "originalText": "⑪ Durable watcher + reminder state\n\nPersist (deal, kind, fired_at) for every reminder and exception the deal_watcher raises; before raising, ask the resolver for an open exception\nat the same stage. Restarts never re-raise; reminders never exceed DEAL_REMINDER_MAX across deploys.\n\nCloses A-5 · X-10",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b3w"
    },
