      "updated": 1792389866279,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "⑫ Commercial unblockers (not code)\n\nLegal entity + IEC + GST + bank AD code · neutral escrow KYB + sandbox + webhook secrets · QIMA account, then Cogoport / Freightos keys · CHA /\nICEGATE registration · own email domain with SPF / DKIM / DMARC · live demand data keys. The code is waiting on these, not the reverse.\n\nCloses 5.B · Phase B / Phase 7 / P1-4 / P1-D1a",
      "fontSize": 12.5,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "dJMl4RmHqdtNkAqTl6Qo",
      "originalText": "⑫ Commercial unblockers (not code)\n\nLegal entity + IEC + GST + bank AD code · neutral escrow KYB + sandbox + webhook secrets · QIMA account, then Cogoport / Freightos keys · CHA /\nICEGATE registration · own email domain with SPF / DKIM / DMARC · live demand data keys. The code is waiting on these, not the reverse.\n\nCloses 5.B · Phase B / Phase 7 / P1-4 / P1-D1a",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b3y"
    },
