      "updated": 1792389866279,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Stage 0 · Today (built-in defaults)\nDISPATCH_RFQ and SEND_DEAL_NOTIFICATION at L2; every other gate L0; money gates clamped to L1. A deal runs end-to-end with an operator clicking ~8 times.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
