      "updated": 1792389866279,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Stage 1 · Shadow mode\nRun every non-money gate at L1 with long timeouts (default_on_timeout=REJECT). Compare what the agent proposed with what the operator chose; track the override rate per action and per product / country. Ship\n③ ④ ⑨ ⑪ here.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "tJWNr8V1klCDwruiMDM6",
      "originalText": "Stage 1 · Shadow mode\nRun every non-money gate at L1 with long timeouts (default_on_timeout=REJECT). Compare what the agent proposed with what the operator chose; track the override rate per action and per product / country. Ship\n③ ④ ⑨ ⑪ here.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b43"
    },
