      "updated": 1792389866279,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Stage 2 · Hands-off, money still asks\nSet all non-money gates to L2 (operating recipe in gap analysis §6), HITL_ON_FIRST_OUTBOUND=false, AUTO_DEAL_FROM_OPPORTUNITY on once ⑤ exists, ⑥ links live, ⑧ playbooks on. Humans only see money gates and\nexhausted-playbook exceptions.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "4m6zmF4HeyX0FmYmOW9h",
      "originalText": "Stage 2 · Hands-off, money still asks\nSet all non-money gates to L2 (operating recipe in gap analysis §6), HITL_ON_FIRST_OUTBOUND=false, AUTO_DEAL_FROM_OPPORTUNITY on once ⑤ exists, ⑥ links live, ⑧ playbooks on. Humans only see money gates and\nexhausted-playbook exceptions.",
