      "updated": 1792389866279,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Stage 3 · Money within limits\nWith ⑦ (ledger + four-eyes) and ⑩ (cross-doc guard) in place, raise AUTONOMY_MONEY_CEILING to L2 below a per-deal value threshold; four-eyes above it. L3 is never used for money — the ledger auto-freeze is\nthe backstop.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "64m0d960mrUJDQcUFFQ7",
      "originalText": "Stage 3 · Money within limits\nWith ⑦ (ledger + four-eyes) and ⑩ (cross-doc guard) in place, raise AUTONOMY_MONEY_CEILING to L2 below a per-deal value threshold; four-eyes above it. L3 is never used for money — the ledger auto-freeze is\nthe backstop.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b47"
